<li><a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/warm-standby.html">Log-shipping standby servers</a> and <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/app-pgbasebackup.html">pg_basebackup</a>: compatible base copies, streaming, standby configuration and promotion's available WAL.</li>
<li><a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/monitoring-stats.html#MONITORING-PG-STAT-REPLICATION-VIEW">Replication statistics</a> and <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/functions-admin.html#FUNCTIONS-RECOVERY-INFO">Recovery functions</a>: sender and receiver positions, lag fields and the synced meaning of receive LSN.</li>
